{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Boundscape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tan, a boy with a hazy past who wakes in a Boundscape called <i>Sanctuary Valley, </i>a tranquil world of rolling hills and calm. A world meant for rest and comfort. But the longer you stay, the more you see the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow Starlight plants, fish with enchanted bait, tackle platforming challenges, help your neighbors with their unusual requests and earn their trust. This world seems safe and warm, and maybe, just... maybe, it's a life worth staying for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath the warmth lies a hidden purpose. To break free, you must solve environmental puzzles and mini-games, gather hidden clues and confront your own reflection, literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/ed0e9cc8d96bd28d7ae6446c5c7294db.avif?t=1759716725\" width=386 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven adventure with environmental puzzle-solving and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games woven into the story - platforming, fishing, memory,\u00a0 puzzles, rhythm, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of scenes: cozy cabins, natural valleys, dark dream worlds, or even a shattered world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet memorable casts, each with backstories and secrets to uncover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by retro adventures and emotional storytelling, Beloved Bound invites players to solve mysteries, bond with unlikely friends, and face the given choice of staying in paradise or returning to a painful reality.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886970?t=1759716725","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/91323151f1c51efd9a31102ef27e6b374e894783/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759716725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/08cb525e92165b4e1abe2e167cb1023c9e9d7e16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759716725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/08cb525e92165b4e1abe2e167cb1023c9e9d7e16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759716725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Beloved Bound covers serious topics like difficult childhood experiences, war, loss, and questions of identity. The game mentions children in war, trying to survive in tough situations, and dealing with feelings about death and memories. There is no graphic violence, blood, or sexual content, but some scenes might feel very emotional or upsetting."},"demos":[{"appid":4023390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Boundscape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tan, a boy with a hazy past who wakes in a Boundscape called <i>Sanctuary Valley, </i>a tranquil world of rolling hills and calm. A world meant for rest and comfort. But the longer you stay, the more you see the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow Starlight plants, fish with enchanted bait, tackle platforming challenges, help your neighbors with their unusual requests and earn their trust. This world seems safe and warm, and maybe, just... maybe, it's a life worth staying for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath the warmth lies a hidden purpose. To break free, you must solve environmental puzzles and mini-games, gather hidden clues and confront your own reflection, literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa